# Expanding the Mission's Splash

Distribution is already solved (existing personal channels) — so "more splash" isn't more platforms, it's **new modes** video can't reach on its own. Split by which goal each serves.

## Reach multipliers (Goal 1 — mass literacy)

- **Folkbildning channels.** ABF / Studieförbundet Vuxenskolan / Medborgarskolan, libraries, komvux. Their mandate *is* literacy for non-curious adults — the exact people personal-channel video won't reach. Uniquely Swedish, on-mission, lends institutional credibility. Highest-leverage non-obvious move.
- **Format spillover from the same content.** Podcast/audio (commute, non-visual), a newsletter, and — critically — **text articles**, because search is where non-technical people land when they Google "hallucinerar AI" at 11pm. Video is invisible to search; text is the literacy funnel.
- **Schools / teacher packs.** Turn an episode into a ready-to-teach 40-min lesson. Reaches teens *and* gets a teacher recommending you to 30 households.

## Authority multipliers (Goal 2 — the voice)

- **Be the phone number Swedish media calls.** This is Goal 2 stated literally. Make yourself press-ready: a one-line "AI-expert, Swedish, explains plainly" pitch + rapid commentary whenever AI hits DN/SvD/Aktuellt. Reactive, low-volume, high-authority.
- **Op-eds / debattartikel.** Origin was a political event — lean in. DN Debatt / SvD Ledare on AI literacy as a public issue. How you get *cited*, not just watched.
- **Panels & policy briefings.** Politicians already showed they don't get it. Being the person invited to explain it to them is the definition of "go-to voice."

## Does both (the real force multiplier)

- **Make the four-bucket framework travel on its own.** It's the signature IP — turn it into a one-page printable / a Swedish shorthand so teachers, journalists, and viewers start *asking* "är det en varaktig fakta eller ett cirkulerande påstående?" without you in the room. When the framework becomes other people's vocabulary, literacy spreads (Goal 1) *and* every use is attributed to you (Goal 2). Highest ceiling of anything here.

---

## The sharp tradeoff

Reach and authority want different bets. **Reach** rewards volume + repurposing + institutions. **Authority** rewards scarcity + being cited by gatekeepers. One calendar can't max both.

